   - **High Calorific Value**: Delivers maximum thermal energy per unit mass consumed;
   - **Moderate/Proper Ignition Temperature**: Neither dangerously low (which causes spontaneous explosive ignition) nor excessively high (which makes ignition difficult);
   - **Low Emission and Environmental Safety**: Leaves behind no unburnt toxic residues, soot, or heavy smoke;
   - **Affordable and Safe**: Readily available, economical, and easily stored and transported without risk of explosion.
